50
00:02:12,442 --> 00:02:13,823
- Oh, those are
 just darling, Crow!

51
00:02:13,823 --> 00:02:15,825
Okay, this one's from me.

52
00:02:15,825 --> 00:02:17,378
- And it is pinking shears!

53
00:02:17,378 --> 00:02:19,518
