54
00:02:19,518 --> 00:02:21,037
- Oh, just like mine!

55
00:02:21,037 --> 00:02:22,383
How darling and lovely!

56
00:02:22,383 --> 00:02:23,902
- Well, yeah, Gypsy,
 I saw that Crow

57
00:02:23,902 --> 00:02:26,007
got you the same thing,
 and that gave me the idea!

58
00:02:26,007 --> 00:02:27,423
[laughing]

59
00:02:27,423 --> 00:02:30,288
- Okay, this one is from Cambot,
and it is pinking shears!

60
00:02:30,288 --> 00:02:32,290
- Oh, I can get pinking!

61
00:02:34,430 --> 00:02:37,191
- Okay, now Tom and Crow
 went in on one more for ya.

62
00:02:37,191 --> 00:02:38,434
- Oh, let me guess,
 let me guess.

63
00:02:38,434 --> 00:02:39,228
Pinking shears?

64
00:02:39,228 --> 00:02:40,677
- Nope.

65
00:02:40,677 --> 00:02:42,541
Well, I guess it
 is, pinking shears.

66
00:02:42,541 --> 00:02:44,164
- Darling and lovely.

67
00:02:44,164 --> 00:02:46,166
- Well, Tom saw them,
 and I had to agree.

68
00:02:46,166 --> 00:02:48,996
Just lovely and
 darling, aren't they?

69
00:02:48,996 --> 00:02:51,516
[quirky music]

70
00:02:55,623 --> 00:02:57,901
