71
00:02:57,901 --> 00:03:00,766
Thank you all so
 much, I, uh, well,

72
00:03:00,766 --> 00:03:02,389
thanks, and everything.

73
00:03:02,389 --> 00:03:04,977
- It was so much fun, Gypsy!

74
00:03:04,977 --> 00:03:07,048
You got so much great stuff.

75
00:03:07,048 --> 00:03:08,533
- Didn't she?

76
00:03:08,533 --> 00:03:10,051
- I really hope you like
 the pinking shears, Gypsy.

77
00:03:10,051 --> 00:03:12,951
I saw those in a catalog
 and I just thought Gypsy.

78
00:03:12,951 --> 00:03:15,229
- Oh, Tom, let me wrap up some
 of that chicken salad for ya.

79
00:03:15,229 --> 00:03:16,368
- Don't you dare, no no.

80
00:03:16,368 --> 00:03:17,300
I'll explode.

81
00:03:17,300 --> 00:03:18,991
- Girls, the mads are calling.

82
00:03:18,991 --> 00:03:21,442
- [Tom and Crow] Lovely!

83
00:03:21,442 --> 00:03:24,238
- Oh, sorry, didn't
 know you had company.

84
00:03:24,238 --> 00:03:28,138
Say, Mike, you haven't seen
Frank around anywhere, have you?

85
00:03:28,138 --> 00:03:30,658
I've looked everywhere,
he didn't leave a note.

86
00:03:30,658 --> 00:03:32,695
The car keys are still here.

87
00:03:32,695 --> 00:03:34,662
He didn't mention
anything to you, did he?

88
00:03:34,662 --> 00:03:36,250
- No, nothing at all.

89
00:03:36,250 --> 00:03:37,941
Did you try all
 the Baskin Robbins?

90
00:03:37,941 --> 00:03:39,391
- Did you try
 comic book college?

91
00:03:39,391 --> 00:03:40,910
- Did you try all
 the emergency rooms?

92
00:03:40,910 --> 00:03:42,152
They all know him there.

93
00:03:42,152 --> 00:03:42,981
- Yeah.

94
00:03:44,569 --> 00:03:48,780
- In the Line of Fire,
 Speed, Blown Away.

95
00:03:48,780 --> 00:03:50,057
Nelson, look!

96
00:03:50,057 --> 00:03:51,576
I was just tidying
 up in Frank's room

97
00:03:51,576 --> 00:03:55,235
