 stubs in Frank's pants pocket.

98
00:03:55,235 --> 00:03:56,650
Now I really am worried.

99
00:03:56,650 --> 00:03:58,479
You know how easily
 influenced Frank is

100
00:03:58,479 --> 00:04:00,240
