101
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,758
- Well, I wouldn't
 worry about it, Dr. F.

102
00:04:01,758 --> 00:04:03,381
I'm sure he's not serious.

103
00:04:03,381 --> 00:04:04,899
Oh, hey, check it out, Gypsy,

104
00:04:04,899 --> 00:04:07,039
there's another gift here
 for you, isn't that lovely?

105
00:04:07,039 --> 00:04:08,317
- It's from Frank!

106
00:04:08,317 --> 00:04:09,283
Listen to this.

107
00:04:09,283 --> 00:04:11,596
"Dear Gypsy, how are you?

108
00:04:11,596 --> 00:04:13,011
"I am fine.

109
00:04:13,011 --> 00:04:17,015
"I am going to bomb the living
 bejeesus out of Deep 13.

110
00:04:17,015 --> 00:04:19,189
"Well, it looks like
 I'm out of room.

111
00:04:19,189 --> 00:04:21,330
"Best wishes, Frank."

112
00:04:21,330 --> 00:04:23,124
Oh my god, Mike, Tom, Crow!

113
00:04:23,124 --> 00:04:25,023
We've gotta stop him!

114
00:04:25,023 --> 00:04:27,853
Oh, "PS, hope you like
 the pinking shears."

115
00:04:27,853 --> 00:04:29,338
Oh, how very thoughtful.

116
00:04:29,338 --> 00:04:31,098
- Well, I wouldn't
 worry about it,

117
00:04:31,098 --> 00:04:32,548
I'm sure Frank's not serious.

118
00:04:32,548 --> 00:04:33,756
- He sure is, Mike.

119
00:04:33,756 --> 00:04:35,240
Those are definitely
 pinking shears.

120
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:37,346
- Not about the pinking,
 I'm talking about the bomb.

121
00:04:37,346 --> 00:04:38,588
Hey, Dr. F, I think
 you should know

122
00:04:38,588 --> 00:04:40,728
