183
00:07:02,318 --> 00:07:04,872
It doesn't matter, just so
 you keep yourself clean.

184
00:07:04,872 --> 00:07:06,702
- [Mike] Use a
 Brillo pad and Comet.

185
00:07:06,702 --> 00:07:07,737
- [Narrator] Remember your ears.

186
00:07:07,737 --> 00:07:09,359
They need a soapy washcloth.

187
00:07:09,359 --> 00:07:13,260
- Kerosene and a match
 gets rid of the ear mites.

188
00:07:13,260 --> 00:07:14,641
- [Narrator] When
 you wash your feet,

189
00:07:14,641 --> 00:07:15,918
be sure to get between your toes

190
00:07:15,918 --> 00:07:17,575
and the bottom of your feet.

191
00:07:17,575 --> 00:07:18,610
- [Tom] But you'll never
be able to scrub away

192
00:07:18,610 --> 00:07:20,543
